<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Welcome to AnyLicence</title>
</head>

<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f4f4; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">

    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#f4f4f4">
        <tr>
            <td align="center" style="padding:20px 0;">

                <!-- Main Container -->
                <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="border-collapse:collapse;">

                    <!-- Header -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="background-color:#3a3a3a; padding:15px 30px 5px;">
                            <img style="width:140px; height:auto"
                                src="https://static.anylicence.com/media/statics/logo.png" alt="AnyLicence" />
                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Body -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding:25px 30px; color:#333333; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6;">

                            <p style="margin:0 0 15px;">
                                <strong>Hi {{instructorName}},</strong>
                            </p>

                            <p style="margin:0 0 15px;">
                                Thank you for joining <strong>AnyLicence</strong> as an Instructor.
                            </p>

                            <p style="margin:0 0 20px;">
                                Your instructor account has been successfully created. AnyLicence helps you connect with
                                genuine learners, manage enquiries, and grow your driving practice efficiently.
                            </p>
                            <p>
                                Our team will review your profile and notify you once verification is complete.
                            </p>

                            <p style="margin:0 0 10px;">
                                <strong>Get started in 3 simple steps:</strong>
                            </p>

                            <ol style="padding-left:18px; margin:0 0 20px;">
                                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                                    Log in to your instructor dashboard:
                                    <a href="https://dev.anylicence.com" style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
                                        Login
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                                    Complete your profile and verification details:
                                    <a href="https://dev.anylicence.com/profile"
                                        style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
                                        Complete Profile
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    Start receiving learner enquiries and managing courses:
                                    <a href="https://dev.anylicence.com/dashboard"
                                        style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
                                        Go to Dashboard
                                    </a>
                                </li>
                            </ol>

                            <p style="margin:0 0 15px;">
                                If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reach us at
                                <a href="mailto:support@anylicence.com" style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
                                    support@anylicence.com
                                </a>.
                            </p>

                            <p style="margin:0 0 25px;">
                                We’re excited to have you onboard and look forward to supporting your success.
                            </p>

                            <p style="margin:0;">
                                <strong>Warm regards,</strong><br />
                                Team AnyLicence<br />
                                <a href="https://www.anylicence.com" style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
                                    www.anylicence.com
                                </a>
                            </p>

                        </td>
                    </tr>

                    <!-- Footer Accent -->
                    <tr>
                        <td style="background-color:#ffb300; height:5px; font-size:0px;"></td>
                    </tr>

                </table>

            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>

</body>

</html>